#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:8
#: 97d143c10ccb483685e58b22b6e8bcdc
msgid ""
"`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller` in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) is"
" a **private** submodule (`ocs2-wbc-controller`). Topics, FSM values, and"
" launch names are in that package README after access. The in-tree loader"
" on the public side is `full_body.launch.py`."
