#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:26
#: 33e4dc2825c84d40a017e92cdc61bb1b
msgid ""
"`full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` `full_body`) spawns "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` when the robot’s `controller_manager` type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`."
msgstr ""
"当机器人 `controller_manager` 的 type 为 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` "
"时，`full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` 为 `full_body`）会拉起 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:28
#: 7b7124c839484c6c8178b318c32e3690
msgid ""
"The same file declares `type` and "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` (`left_type` / `right_type`, "
"`use_profile_eef`). End-effectors: "
"[ocs2_arm_controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) and "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"同一文件声明 `type` 和 `create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`（`left_type` / "
"`right_type`、`use_profile_eef`）。末端见 "
"[ocs2_arm_controller](2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) 与 "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)。"

