#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:43
#: 0a5b1a922aee431381caa9208187073a
msgid ""
"These topics need **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** and that robot’s 全身 "
"launch/config. Default mock demos (`demo.launch.py`) and 分体 "
"(`split_body.launch.py`) do **not** imply they are present. Capability "
"bits (`WbcCapability`) are machine-dependent. Public Taku mock uses "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku` (arm MPC + body/head basic + "
"grippers), not WBC. `full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` needs the private "
"WBC submodule; shipping `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` is not enough. "
"When that config and the private module are present, Taku full-body "
"default `headMode` is `HEAD_GAZE` (gaze on "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`); `target_manager.yaml` has "
"`enable_head_control: false`. Head 6D tracking (`HEAD_TRACKING`) is only "
"there when `head_tracking_ee_enabled` is true. Taku body-relative rest is"
" around x≈−0.21, not Bot2 `[0, 0.25]`. Full tables: [FSM and "
"Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些话题需要 **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** 以及该机型的全身启动/配置。默认 mock "
"演示（`demo.launch.py`）和分体（`split_body.launch.py`）**并不表示**它们可用。能力位（`WbcCapability`）取决于机型。公开的"
" Taku mock 使用 `split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`（臂 MPC + 身体/头 basic + "
"夹爪），不是 WBC。`full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` 需要私有 WBC 子模块；描述里有 "
"`config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` 并不够。当该配置和私有模块都在时，Taku 全身默认 `headMode` 是"
" `HEAD_GAZE`（注视 `head_camera_mid_optical_frame`）；`target_manager.yaml` 里 "
"`enable_head_control: false`。头部 6D 跟踪（`HEAD_TRACKING`）只有 "
"`head_tracking_ee_enabled` 为真时才有。Taku 身体相对静止位大约在 x≈−0.21，不是 Bot2 的 `[0, "
"0.25]`。完整表格：[FSM 与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

